<title>USA: ITT Corp Q1 profits rose.</title>
<headline>ITT Corp Q1 profits rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.27		    $0.15</p>
<p> Oper net		   32,000		   17,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,411,000		1,328,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  117,900		  118,800</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q1 consensus estimate $0.14.</p>
<p>Revenues exclude revenues from assets held for disposition of $29 million vs $60 million.</p>
<p>Operating net excludes loss $13 million, or $0.11/shr, vs profit $3 million, or $0.02/shr, from assets held for disposition.</p>
<p>1997 operating net also excludes gain on sale of Alcatel Alsthom stake of $106 million, or $0.90 per share; restructuring charges of $33 million, or $0.28/shr; and Hilton proposal costs of $12 million, or $0.10/shr.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
